# The servers' images (rust/server/geo/Dockerfile, rust/server/api/Dockerfile)
# build from the repository's root, the one directory holding both trees they
# copy: rust/ and the xpute crates it links by path, xpute/rust/. Docker reads
# this file only at the context's root, so it lives here, and lets in those two
# trees alone.

*
!rust
!xpute/rust
**/target
rust/client/shader/target-linux
rust/client/shader/cargo-home
